Text-VCardFast version 0.05
===========================

Text::VCardFast is a module for parsing and creating VCards.  It
contains both a pure perl and an XS implementation.  The pure-perl
is provided just for comparison - the XS implementation is faster
and designed to handle all existing RFCs for VCard format.

INSTALLATION

To install this module type the following:

   perl Makefile.PL
   make
   make test
   make install

DEPENDENCIES

This module requires these other modules and libraries:

  JSON::XS - for the test suite

